component.documentation:
WebDAV Direct Edit service.
There is deliberately no extension point: the Office format lists, the main blob xpath and the feature flag all come from the org.nuxeo.web.ui.webdavDirectEdit.* configuration properties (see webdav-directedit-properties.xml), which is the exact same source the Web UI client reads. This guarantees the client and the server can never disagree about which documents show the button.
@since 2025.1
